Review these previously model-flagged conflict pairs against the supplied quotations and scope/date fields. Do not assume every pair is a conflict. Different products, origins, tariff programs, or dated stages are not automatically contradictory. Only use apparent_same_scope_conflict when the supplied claims appear incompatible on the same scope/date; otherwise distinguish dated progression, differing scope, complementary claims, and missing scope. Do not verify current law from memory. Explain the reason briefly for every pair.
UNTRUSTED_EVIDENCE_JSON:
{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_7c2b7a39d45e1e160fe20b29", "claim_ids": ["claim_9cf56842fbc120d4e2d9b2cd", "claim_c893e935c346b37711450224"], "query_ids": ["q_377"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_9cf56842fbc120d4e2d9b2cd", "quote": "Covered products of China are generally subject to an additional 12.5% Section 301 duty under the forced-labor action effective July 24, 2026, unless a product exemption applies.", "url": "https://www.large-battery.com/blog/us-tariff-on-chinese-lithium-ion-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "12.5%", "announcement_date": "July 24, 2026"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_c893e935c346b37711450224", "quote": "On July 23, 2026, USTR announced final action in Section 301 investigations concerning the failure of 60 economies to impose and effectively enforce prohibitions on imports produced with forced labor. Products of China are generally subject to an additional 12.5% Section 301 duty under this action, unless covered by an exemption.", "url": "https://www.large-battery.com/blog/us-tariff-on-chinese-lithium-ion-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "legal_authority": "USTR", "duty_rate": "12.5%", "effective_date": "July 24, 2026"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_8b63c3c1f67e60bcef4b9d5b", "claim_ids": ["claim_2cdb7fce00f997e6aa6f018a", "claim_dbcc08567604182eba96470d"], "query_ids": ["q_378"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_2cdb7fce00f997e6aa6f018a", "quote": "The U.S. government currently levies a 38.4 percent tariff on Chinese EV batteries, with a 10 percent “baseline tariff” newly added in April.", "url": "https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/business/exclusive-us-ev-battery-imports-from-korea-top-1300-as-tariffs-push-shift-from-china/11937242", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "U.S. government", "duty_rate": "38.4 percent", "effective_date": "April"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_dbcc08567604182eba96470d", "quote": "South Korea - January 2025: Battery imports from South Korea are subject to a 25% tariff, affecting energy storage systems and electric vehicle batteries.", "url": "https://manlybattery.com/battery-tools-and-resources/usa-import-duty-calculator", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "January 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_c235c62e604c94d9bf05e9e8", "claim_ids": ["claim_a7e9cd574dd1880ab3fdc992", "claim_ac3085e5fa39afdd634a0a36"], "query_ids": ["q_378"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_a7e9cd574dd1880ab3fdc992", "quote": "Korean products, which enjoyed a zero percent tariff for decades under the Korea-U.S. FTA, are now subject to a 15 percent tariff.", "url": "https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/business/exclusive-us-ev-battery-imports-from-korea-top-1300-as-tariffs-push-shift-from-china/11937242", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Korea-U.S. FTA", "duty_rate": "15 percent"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ac3085e5fa39afdd634a0a36", "quote": "And US companies now have to pay a 15% tax on those batteries, where previously they didn't.", "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/electricvehicles/comments/1mp1jzn/exclusive_us_ev_battery_imports_from_korea_top", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "US companies", "duty_rate": "15%", "effective_date": "now"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_a0370b1759f8978750d44162", "claim_ids": ["claim_26c6882f7083e8034372ad81", "claim_c213ed65262e143a4423ce0c"], "query_ids": ["q_379"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_26c6882f7083e8034372ad81", "quote": "February 2025: A 24% tariff is applied to battery products imported from Japan. These tariffs impact products used in automotive manufacturing and energy storage systems.", "url": "https://manlybattery.com/battery-tools-and-resources/usa-import-duty-calculator", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "24%", "effective_date": "February 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_c213ed65262e143a4423ce0c", "quote": "South Korea and Japan, as major battery manufacturers, now sit in the forced-labor tariff's 10% tier", "url": "https://www.tariffstool.com/tariffs-on-energy-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"country_of_origin": "Japan", "duty_rate": "10%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_8634d999c45f2b9894d36e0d", "claim_ids": ["claim_026c49a30f22ecabd38d0c74", "claim_5c055a95028b50fad3f515cc"], "query_ids": ["q_380"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_026c49a30f22ecabd38d0c74", "quote": "We expect the Commission to place provisional duties on Chinese EV imports by early July.", "url": "https://rhg.com/research/aint-no-duty-high-enough", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "provisional duties", "affected_product": "Chinese EV imports", "announcement_date": "early July"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_5c055a95028b50fad3f515cc", "quote": "Should it determine that China-based producers have benefited from subsidies in ways that harm EU-based manufacturers, it could place provisional countervailing duties on China-origin EV imports anytime from now until July 3, and final duties by early November.", "url": "https://rhg.com/research/aint-no-duty-high-enough", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "provisional countervailing duties", "effective_date": "anytime from now until July 3"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_ab73194a2e6e4232e55754d8", "claim_ids": ["claim_4e65ff315fdff7255fd0d4cd", "claim_e3c7338c0337e4a1c68f4cb5"], "query_ids": ["q_381"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_4e65ff315fdff7255fd0d4cd", "quote": "automakers produce EVs outside China—such as in Mexico or elsewhere—where the STT is satisfied. In such cases, the 100 percent tariff under Section 301 may be avoided, although the vehicle would remain subject to the 25 percent tariff under Section 232.", "url": "https://scholarship.law.duke.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1618&context=djcil", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "100 percent"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_e3c7338c0337e4a1c68f4cb5", "quote": "If assembly takes place in Mexico, an additional 25 percent tariff under the IEEPA would apply unless the EVs qualify as USMCA-originating goods.", "url": "https://scholarship.law.duke.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1618&context=djcil", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25 percent"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_11b5a9cd64391ee59e42e4a0", "claim_ids": ["claim_4530f8e30c770a7d8fbf9738", "claim_d4fc3d390b9aae8826879177"], "query_ids": ["q_381"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_4530f8e30c770a7d8fbf9738", "quote": "if the vehicle were not fully compliant, either because the requirements for EV batteries and components are not met (as is the case with some other EVs currently being imported into the United States from Mexico) or because of a failure to meet the 75% regional value component and/or the $16 per hour requirements, the vehicles would normally enter the United States at the 2.5% MFN tariff rate", "url": "https://digitalcommons.wcl.american.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=2167&context=auilr", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"exporting_country": "Mexico", "duty_rate": "2.5%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_d4fc3d390b9aae8826879177", "quote": "Increased U.S. tariffs on vehicles imported from China or Chinese vehicles assembled in Mexico and imported into the United States could be imposed in a relatively brief period of time, without regard to whether any Chinese-owned car producers were currently exporting cars from Mexico in anticipation of possible future imports.", "url": "https://digitalcommons.wcl.american.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=2167&context=auilr", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Increased U.S. tariffs", "exporting_country": "Mexico"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_6c22797cf4ac982425bb175e", "claim_ids": ["claim_369d21034369afb10af06fa4", "claim_cffdafb55bf6b8e5080ed314"], "query_ids": ["q_382"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_369d21034369afb10af06fa4", "quote": "assembly of battery cells into battery packs does not result in a substantial transformation", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/H316389", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_cffdafb55bf6b8e5080ed314", "quote": "The battery modules are manufactured into battery packs containing multiple battery modules. Both the battery modules and battery packs are assembled in Canada through multi-step assembly processes that include: applying adhesive, aligning, pressing, curing, plasma cleaning, laser ablation, wire bonding, material", "url": "https://www.cmtradelaw.com/2023/01/customs-ruling-of-the-week-country-of-origin-of-battery-modules-and-battery-packs-and-the-applicability-of-certain-trade-remedies-under-section-301", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_a0e7efdfb99a5e9bb137be37", "claim_ids": ["claim_05085d399182ad5430aab4d7", "claim_2c1a41ac0cca30e4eb62405e"], "query_ids": ["q_383"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_05085d399182ad5430aab4d7", "quote": "Lithium-ion EV batteries – August 1, 2024, increase from 7.5% to 25%", "url": "https://www.millercanfield.com/resources-USTR-Starts-New-Section-301-Tariffs.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301 tariffs", "affected_product": "Lithium-ion EV batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "August 1, 2024"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_2c1a41ac0cca30e4eb62405e", "quote": "Lithium-ion electrical vehicle batteries—Increase rate to 25% in 2024", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2024/09/18/2024-21217/notice-of-modification-chinas-acts-policies-and-practices-related-to-technology-transfer", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"affected_product": "Lithium-ion electrical vehicle batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "2024"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_cb2305bb82e15e089a4b669d", "claim_ids": ["claim_05085d399182ad5430aab4d7", "claim_99cf6bfc77bfa6375d98efcb"], "query_ids": ["q_383"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_05085d399182ad5430aab4d7", "quote": "Lithium-ion EV batteries – August 1, 2024, increase from 7.5% to 25%", "url": "https://www.millercanfield.com/resources-USTR-Starts-New-Section-301-Tariffs.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301 tariffs", "affected_product": "Lithium-ion EV batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "August 1, 2024"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_99cf6bfc77bfa6375d98efcb", "quote": "the USTR delayed the 25% tariff on 'non-EV' lithium-ion batteries until 2026.", "url": "https://energy-solutions.co/policy-intelligence/trade-and-tariffs/us-section-301-tariffs-ev-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "USTR", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "2026", "reported_policy_status": "delayed"}}]}]}

